  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "If &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;are unit vectors and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math> is perpendicular to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math> is perpendicular to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then the angle between&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> (in degrees) is _________.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "60",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8869;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Therefore,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>7</mn><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>7</mn><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>30</mn><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>From <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
